    "The M2 incremental comparison was development-only and completed (stage127-m2-incremental-evaluation, roadmap item 24).",
    "The exact M2 common sample was 539 of 666 development rows: 55 positive, 484 negative, 108 companies.",
    "Parent-to-common-sample attrition was 127 of 666 rows (13 positive, 114 negative, 53 distinct companies), a proportion of 0.1906906907.",
